OL,3,GNEWSACouncil condemns attacks on bin
OL,4,Acrews and traffic wardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FTargeting bin crews and traffic wardens
OL,7,Fout doing their jobs is "unacceptable",
OL,8,Fa council has said, after a wagon had a
OL,9,Fbrick thrown through its window while
OL,10,Fout on its rounds.
OL,12,FAt least one traffic warden was also
OL,13,Fsaid to have been targeted in the
OL,14,FGoldwick area, Oldham Council said.
OL,16,FSpeaking after the bin wagon incident
OL,17,Flast month, a spokesperson said the
OL,18,Fwagon had its driver-side window
OL,19,Fsmashed "by a resident" and a parking
OL,20,Fenforcement officer was subjected to
OL,21,Fabuse.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
