OL,3,GNEWSACouncil condemns attacks on bin
OL,4,Acrews and traffic wardens
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Our staff are working hard every day
OL,7,Fto deliver essential services for
OL,8,Fcommunities across the borough. These
OL,9,Funacceptable actions not only put
OL,10,Fpeople at risk but also delay services
OL,11,Ffor other residents," they added.
